{"pages":[{"w":612.0,"h":792.0,"s":[[13.889,2.208,18.127,3.8,3.431,"EQUINOX"],[13.889,5.306,15.104,1.205,1.078,"Q U A N T I T A T I V E"],[69.444,2.807,13.975,1.643,1.471,"US Equity Research"],[69.444,4.27,11.117,1.46,1.307,"18 November 2026"],[13.889,10.996,11.076,3.651,3.268,"NVIDIA"],[13.889,14.731,48.168,2.373,2.124,"Rubin ships as the board seeks Huang’s successor"],[13.889,20.845,52.942,1.81,1.634,"NVIDIA earned $2.70 a share in Q3 on $115.8bn of revenue, $7.8bn above its"],[13.889,22.29,52.942,1.81,1.634,"August outlook. Data Center sales doubled to $107.6bn as Vera Rubin racks"],[13.889,23.736,52.941,1.81,1.634,"began shipping. The quarter ended on 25 October, before Jensen Huang’s"],[13.889,25.182,52.941,1.81,1.634,"departure as CEO and director, announced on 12 November. CFO Colette Kress"],[13.889,26.627,52.941,1.81,1.634,"is interim CEO while the board searches for a successor. Huang said on 17"],[13.889,28.073,52.941,1.81,1.634,"November he would return if asked. That day, the board formed a committee to"],[13.889,29.519,52.942,1.81,1.634,"oversee export controls. The shares closed 10.5% below their 11 November"],[13.889,30.965,3.585,1.81,1.634,"level."],[13.889,33.452,52.941,1.81,1.634,"1) At the $130bn midpoint of Q4 guidance, FY27 sales reach $423.7bn, up 96%."],[13.889,34.898,52.941,1.81,1.634,"Q4 includes an extra week and assumes zero China data center compute sales. 2)"],[13.889,36.343,52.943,1.81,1.634,"Gross margin falls from 74.8% in Q3 to 71.5% at the Q4 midpoint. We estimate"],[13.889,37.789,52.941,1.81,1.634,"Q4 EPS of $2.82 on $11bn of operating expenses. 3) FY28 sales rise 54% to"],[13.889,39.235,52.941,1.81,1.634,"$652bn as Rubin shipments scale, below management’s preliminary 70%"],[13.889,40.68,52.941,1.81,1.634,"growth view in August. 4) We model $14.22 of FY28 EPS at a 72% gross"],[13.889,42.126,52.942,1.81,1.634,"margin. Q3 free cash flow was $43.8bn against $65.3bn of net income."],[13.889,43.572,39.98,1.81,1.634,"Receivables absorbed $18.1bn and inventory another $8.1bn."],[13.889,46.059,52.941,1.81,1.634,"Our Dec-27 target of $206 averages $237 on earnings and $175 on cash flow."],[13.889,47.505,52.941,1.81,1.634,"We apply 14x FY29 EPS of $16.93, below today’s 16.7x trailing multiple while"],[13.889,48.951,52.942,1.81,1.634,"the CEO search is open. Our DCF reserves 15% of free cash flow for strategic"],[13.889,50.396,52.941,1.81,1.634,"investments and uses an 11.5% cost of equity. The 33% upside earns an"],[13.889,51.842,52.942,1.81,1.634,"Overweight rating. We assume the next CEO keeps major cloud customers"],[13.889,53.288,52.941,1.81,1.634,"through the Rubin rollout. We assign no value to a Huang return. One turn of the"],[13.889,54.733,52.943,1.81,1.634,"earnings multiple moves the blended target by $8.46. Faster Rubin deliveries"],[13.889,56.179,52.008,1.81,1.634,"could lift sales. Delayed cloud orders or tighter export controls would cut them."],[69.444,11.255,12.458,2.556,2.288,"Overweight"],[69.444,13.81,10.094,1.46,1.307,"NVDA, NASDAQ"],[69.444,15.113,15.621,1.46,1.307,"Price (17 Nov 26): $155.46"],[69.444,16.699,18.599,1.46,1.307,"Price Target (Dec-27): $206.00"],[69.461,20.733,13.974,1.643,1.471,"US Semiconductors"],[69.444,22.584,7.565,1.552,1.389,"Yash Sarda"],[69.444,24.023,20.153,1.278,1.144,"Analyst, Equinox Quantitative Research"],[69.444,25.109,11.888,1.278,1.144,"Accelerated Computing"],[69.461,28.233,10.296,1.643,1.471,"Company Data"],[69.444,29.547,11.739,1.5,1.307,"Shares O/S, Aug 21 (bn)"],[92.415,29.547,2.682,1.5,1.307,"24.10"],[69.444,30.684,12.929,1.5,1.307,"Q3 diluted shares, avg (bn)"],[92.415,30.684,2.682,1.5,1.307,"24.19"],[69.444,31.82,8.698,1.5,1.307,"52-week range ($)"],[87.944,31.82,7.153,1.5,1.307,"148.80–243.37"],[69.444,32.957,10.128,1.5,1.307,"Market cap, est. ($tn)"],[93.012,32.957,2.086,1.5,1.307,"3.75"],[69.444,34.093,13.435,1.5,1.307,"Cash + debt securities ($bn)"],[93.012,34.093,2.086,1.5,1.307,"53.5"],[69.444,35.229,8.818,1.5,1.307,"Debt, 25 Oct (